      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T10:31:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suppose because of encoding: `str` implies UTF-8 but libfdt really only expects ASCII strings. I\u0027ve replaced it with `\u0026CStr` as there\u0027s no need to leak the fact that the implementation calls the `_namelen` variant of the function (which doesn\u0027t reach the `\u0027\\0\u0027`).",
      "parentUuid": "2b6fa3c1_bfbef0ce",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 104,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 104,
        "endChar": 50
