        "uuid": "b059cbfd_f3c8e07d",
        "filename": "libs/libfdt/src/ffi.rs",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 106,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T10:31:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`libfdt` shouldn\u0027t read past the `fdt_header::totalsize`: cs/android/external/dtc/libfdt/fdt.h?l\u003d14, which we can trust if `fdt_check_full` succeeded. The safe wrappers are now methods of a `Fdt` struct that validates the slice in its constructor.",
      "parentUuid": "9a81b2c3_55e4804a",
      "revId": "8d020b66c4669427a9ad7d849bc900449a10132a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
