      "lineNbr": 121,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-14T10:31:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this particular case, it returns `FDT_ERR_BADOFFSET`: cs/android/external/dtc/libfdt/fdt.c?l\u003d232\n\nBut, having patched bugs where libfdt happily worked with negative values (such as sizes), I don\u0027t think we should rely on the library to validate its inputs and all bindgen arguments are now `try_into`-ed.",
